OL,3,GNEWSALidl crash driver 'had medical
OL,4,Aincident at the wheel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of a car that crashed
OL,7,Fthrough the entrance of a Lidl in
OL,8,FWolverhampton is believed to have
OL,9,Fsuffered a medical incident at the
OL,10,Fwheel, an ambulance service has said.
OL,12,FA man in his 30s was pronounced dead at
OL,13,Fthe scene in Finchfield Hill after the
OL,14,Fcrash, which West Midlands Ambulance
OL,15,FService was called to just before 18:00
OL,16,FBST on Friday.
OL,18,FThe service said the man was inside the
OL,19,Fbuilding and received advanced life
OL,20,Fsupport from paramedics but could not
OL,21,Fbe saved.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
