OL,3,GNEWSALidl crash driver 'had medical
OL,4,Aincident at the wheel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the woman driving the car was
OL,7,Ftreated at the scene before being taken
OL,8,Fto hospital for further assessment.
